  },
  {
   "id": "h120",
   "kind": "html",
   "en": "<span class=\"spec\"><b>4×8/side</b></span>\n              <span class=\"spec dim\">30X1 · heavy · 8</span>\n              <span class=\"spec rest\">REST 60s</span>"
  },
  {
   "id": "h121",
   "kind": "html",
   "en": "Fast hip snap on the way up. Protect the hamstring at top speed."
  },
  {
   "id": "h122",
   "kind": "html",
   "en": "<span class=\"ex-idx\">03</span>\n              <a class=\"ex\" data-video=\"https://pub-40102464ff0f4d61a636f1749e9d3111.r2.dev/copenhagen_plank_long.mp4\" href=\"https://elitehockeydrills.com/exercises/copenhagen-plank-long\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">Copenhagen Plank (Long)<span class=\"lk\" aria-hidden=\"true\">↗</span></a>"
  },
  {
   "id": "h123",
   "kind": "html",
   "en": "<span class=\"spec\"><b>3×40s/side</b></span>\n              <span class=\"spec dim\">iso · 8</span>\n              <span class=\"spec rest\">REST 45s</span>"
  },
  {
   "id": "h124",
   "kind": "html",
   "en": "Adductor #1. Long lever, top foot on the box — the test, trained."
  },
  {
   "id": "h125",
   "kind": "html",
   "en": "<span class=\"ex-idx\">04</span>\n              <a class=\"ex\" data-video=\"https://pub-40102464ff0f4d61a636f1749e9d3111.r2.dev/pallof_march.mp4\" href=\"https://elitehockeydrills.com/exercises/pallof-march\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">Pallof March<span class=\"lk\" aria-hidden=\"true\">↗</span></a>"
  },
  {
   "id": "h126",
   "kind": "html",
   "en": "<span class=\"spec\"><b>3×10/side</b></span>\n              <span class=\"spec dim\">slow · medium · 7</span>\n              <span class=\"spec rest\">REST 45s</span>"
  },
  {
   "id": "h127",
   "kind": "html",
   "en": "Anti-rotation under a moving base. March tall, do not let the band twist you."
  },
  {
   "id": "h128",
