  },
  {
   "id": "a141",
   "kind": "attr:alt",
   "en": "Coach David Ciboch, M.Ed. Sport Science, performing a barbell squat"
  },
  {
   "id": "h142",
   "kind": "html",
   "en": "<span class=\"cb-dot\"></span><span><b>Coach David Ciboch</b><span>M.Ed. Sport Science · National-Team S&amp;C</span></span>"
  },
  {
   "id": "h143",
   "kind": "html",
   "en": "Who built this"
  },
  {
   "id": "h144",
   "kind": "html",
   "en": "Coached at the <em>national-team level.</em>"
  },
  {
   "id": "h145",
   "kind": "html",
   "en": "DOMINATE isn’t a template from the internet. Every session was periodized by <strong style=\"color:var(--ink);font-weight:600;\">Coach David Ciboch</strong> — M.Ed. Sport Science, a decade of coaching through to the UAE National Ice Hockey Team, built for adult players who want their training to actually transfer."
  },
  {
   "id": "h146",
   "kind": "html",
   "en": "Master’s Degree (M.Ed.) — PE &amp; Sport Science"
  },
  {
   "id": "h147",
   "kind": "html",
   "en": "Certified Strength &amp; Conditioning Coach"
  },
  {
   "id": "h148",
   "kind": "html",
   "en": "Former National Team Coach — UAE Ice Hockey"
  },
  {
   "id": "h149",
   "kind": "html",
   "en": "1,000+ athletes developed across 30+ countries"
  },
  {
   "id": "h150",
   "kind": "html",
   "en": "02 — What's Inside"
  },
  {
   "id": "h151",
   "kind": "html",
   "en": "Everything you need to <em>get faster.</em>"
  },
  {
   "id": "h152",
   "kind": "html",
   "en": "A complete, coach-built block of off-ice speed and power — written for a trained 19–39 player, not a beginner."
  },
  {
   "id": "h153",
   "kind": "html",
   "en": "32 Coach-Built Sessions"
  },
  {
   "id": "h154",
   "kind": "html",
   "en": "Four sessions a week for eight weeks, each 60–75 minutes. Every session runs the same six-block architecture — just run them in order."
  },
  {
   "id": "h155",
   "kind": "html",
   "en": "Video for Every Exercise"
  },
  {
   "id": "h156",
   "kind": "html",
   "en": "No guessing what a move looks like. Every single exercise links to a clean demo video you can copy in seconds."
  },
  {
   "id": "h157",
   "kind": "html",
   "en": "6 Combine Tests"
  },
  {
   "id": "h158",
   "kind": "html",
   "en": "Six measurable, pro-style combine tests — a real number to beat at Week 1, 4 and 8. No guesswork, just proof."
  },
  {
   "id": "h159",
   "kind": "html",
   "en": "Easier &amp; Harder Scaling"
  },
  {
   "id": "h160",
   "kind": "html",
   "en": "Every move comes with a simpler version and a harder version — so you can match the intent to the day, fresh or fatigued."
  },
  {
   "id": "h161",
   "kind": "html",
   "en": "The RAMP Warm-Up"
  },
  {
   "id": "h162",
   "kind": "html",
   "en": "A built-in 8–10 minute warm-up before every session — Raise, Activate, Mobilize, Potentiate — that primes your nervous system so the fast, powerful work is actually fast and powerful."
  },
  {
   "id": "h163",
   "kind": "html",
   "en": "Full Glossary &amp; Notes"
  },
  {
   "id": "h164",
   "kind": "html",
   "en": "Plain-English coaching notes and the science behind every block — so you know exactly what you're training, and why."
  },
  {
   "id": "h165",
   "kind": "html",
   "en": "03 — The Plan"
  },
  {
   "id": "h166",
   "kind": "html",
   "en": "The 8-week <em>journey.</em>"
  },
  {
   "id": "h167",
   "kind": "html",
   "en": "Two four-week blocks — block periodization on the force–velocity curve. Volume climbs to a peak, then unloads, so you arrive at each test sharp, not buried."
  },
  {
   "id": "h168",
   "kind": "html",
   "en": "<span class=\"jb-label\">Block 1</span><span class=\"jb-weeks\">Weeks 1–4</span>"
  },
  {
   "id": "h169",
   "kind": "html",
   "en": "Specific Prep"
  },
  {
   "id": "h170",
   "kind": "html",
   "en": "Intensive plyometrics, banded contrast strength, resisted and hill acceleration, alactic capacity, and weekly rotational power. Volume builds Week 1→3, then Week 4 deloads and you re-test."
  },
  {
   "id": "h171",
   "kind": "html",
   "en": "<span class=\"jb-label\">Block 2</span><span class=\"jb-weeks\">Weeks 5–8</span>"
  },
  {
   "id": "h172",
   "kind": "html",
   "en": "Power Realization"
  },
  {
   "id": "h173",
   "kind": "html",
   "en": "Reactive and shock plyos, max-velocity sprinting, reactive change-of-direction, and shift-simulation conditioning. Volume builds Week 5→7, then Week 8 tapers into the final combine."
  },
  {
   "id": "h174",
   "kind": "html",
   "en": "Power = force × velocity. Block 1 lifts the force end, Block 2 extends the velocity end — so your whole curve shifts up and to the right. More power in every stride, and every shot."
  },
  {
   "id": "h175",
   "kind": "html",
   "en": "<span class=\"ms-wk\">Week 4</span><span class=\"ms-txt\">Deload + mid-block test</span>"
  },
  {
   "id": "h176",
   "kind": "html",
   "en": "<span class=\"ms-wk\">Week 8</span><span class=\"ms-txt\">Taper + final combine</span>"
  },
  {
   "id": "h177",
   "kind": "html",
   "en": "04 — A Week"
  },
  {
   "id": "h178",
   "kind": "html",
   "en": "The weekly <em>rhythm.</em>"
  },
  {
   "id": "h179",
   "kind": "html",
   "en": "Four sessions a week, with at least 48 hours between the two intensive lower-body days. The four days rotate focus so every quality gets trained — and nothing burns out."
  },
  {
   "id": "h180",
   "kind": "html",
   "en": "Day 1"
  },
  {
   "id": "h181",
   "kind": "html",
   "en": "Lower-Body Power"
  },
  {
   "id": "h182",
   "kind": "html",
   "en": "Vertical, linear, and posterior-chain power — the explosive base of every stride and first step."
  },
  {
   "id": "h183",
   "kind": "html",
   "en": "Day 2"
  },
  {
   "id": "h184",
   "kind": "html",
   "en": "Upper-Body Power"
  },
  {
   "id": "h185",
   "kind": "html",
   "en": "Push, pull, and anti-rotation core — upper-body power and the trunk that transfers it to the ice."
  },
  {
   "id": "h186",
   "kind": "html",
   "en": "Day 3"
  },
  {
   "id": "h187",
   "kind": "html",
   "en": "Lateral Power"
  },
  {
   "id": "h188",
   "kind": "html",
   "en": "Speed, agility, and adductor focus — the edges, cuts, and lateral explosiveness that beat defenders."
  },
  {
   "id": "h189",
   "kind": "html",
   "en": "Day 4"
  },
  {
   "id": "h190",
   "kind": "html",
   "en": "Full-Body Power + Energy"
  },
  {
   "id": "h191",
   "kind": "html",
   "en": "A lower-CNS, sustainable fourth day — full-body power plus the energy work that holds up late in games."
  },
  {
   "id": "h192",
   "kind": "html",
   "en": "At least 48 hours sits between the two intensive lower-body days — power is built on quality, and quality needs recovery."
  },
  {
   "id": "h193",
   "kind": "html",
   "en": "05 — Proof"
  },
  {
   "id": "h194",
   "kind": "html",
   "en": "Progress you can <em>measure.</em>"
  },
  {
   "id": "h195",
   "kind": "html",
   "en": "Six measurable combine tests — every one gives you a number to beat. Re-test at Week 1, 4 and 8. Small on paper, large on the ice."
