   "en": "Trusted by serious <em>players.</em>"
  },
  {
   "id": "h228",
   "kind": "html",
   "en": "From trained players who wanted real, testable speed and power — with bands, a pull-up bar, and bodyweight."
  },
  {
   "id": "h229",
   "kind": "html",
   "en": "I'm 31 and faster than I was at 25. My CMJ and 10m both moved in eight weeks — and I did the whole thing with bands in my basement."
  },
